<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  5.12%				    O/N = 7.67%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  6.69%				    T/N = 5.12%</p>
<p>		   Oct 3, 1996			Oct 1, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.14%	1 month forward =  6.14%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.21%	2 month forward =  6.31%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.95%	3 month forward =  7.28%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.71%	4 month forward =  8.02%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.03%	5 month forward =  8.40%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.25%	6 month forward =  8.64%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
